      "page": 304,
      "ruku": 262,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2242,
      "text": "Do the disbelievers think that they can take My slaves as allies instead of Me? We have prepared Hell as a dwelling place for the disbelievers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 102,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 304,
      "ruku": 263,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2243,
      "text": "Say, “Shall we inform you of the greatest losers in terms of their deeds?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 103,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 304,
      "ruku": 263,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2244,
      "text": "Those whose efforts in the life of this world are wasted, while they think that they are doing well[54].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 104,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 304,
      "ruku": 263,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2245,
      "text": "It is those who disbelieve in the verses of their Lord and their meeting with Him; their deeds will be nullified, and We will give no weight to them on the Day of Resurrection[55].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 105,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 304,
      "ruku": 263,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2246,
      "text": "That is their recompense: Hell, because of their disbelief and taking My verses and messengers in ridicule.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 106,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 304,
      "ruku": 263,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2247,
      "text": "As for those who believe and do righteous deeds, they will have gardens of Paradise[56] as a dwelling place[57],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
